---
title: V60 five pour by Matt Winton
source: https://honestcoffeeguide.com/brew-recipes/matt-winton-v60-five-pour/
filter: paper
---

@V60 20g 300g 93°C
grind medium

/rinse
/level-bed
60g bloom spiral -- circular motions, wet the coffee evenly
/wait
120g spiral -- from a height, for some agitation
/wait ~30s -- or until the bed runs dry
180g spiral
/wait ~30s
240g spiral
/wait ~30s
88°C -- second kettle, or let the kettle cool
300g spiral
/drawdown ~3:30
/swirl -- then smell the aroma while it cools

target 6:50
